%% frame: UC4 A7: two payments race for the last seat (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as :StripePaymentAppService
    participant A as txA : StripeCheckoutService
    participant B as txB : StripeCheckoutService
    participant OFA as :OrderFulfilmentAdapter
    participant Groups as :PaidGroupDealService
    participant Repo as :CheckoutPaymentRepository

    Note over App,B: A7, at B7: two verified webhooks from StripeWebhookController (@sec-a-pay-upfront), one thread each
    par buyer X's webhook
        App->>A: handleWebhook(rawX, sigX)
    and buyer Y's webhook
        App->>B: handleWebhook(rawY, sigY)
    end
    A->>OFA: lockForSettlement(quoteX)
    Note over A,OFA: txA holds the team row lock (lock 1)
    B->>OFA: lockForSettlement(quoteY)
    Note over B,OFA: txB waits on the same team row
    A->>OFA: fulfil(eventX)
    OFA->>Groups: joinConfirmed(dealId, paidX, sharer)
    Groups-->>OFA: applied, team SUCCEEDED
    OFA-->>A: Outcome(dealId, orderX, null)
    Note over A: txA commits; lock released
    A-->>App: void
    OFA-->>B: void: lock granted
    B->>OFA: fulfil(eventY)
    OFA->>Groups: joinConfirmed(dealId, paidY, sharer)
    Groups-->>OFA: compensation_required, DEAL_CLOSED
    OFA-->>B: Outcome(dealId, null, "GROUP_REJECTED")
    B->>Repo: requireRefund(paymentY, "GROUP_REJECTED", eventY)
    B->>Repo: recordOutcome(paymentY, dealId, null, "REFUND_REQUIRED")
    Note over B: txB commits
    B-->>App: void
